WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.682
We have a new baby.

2
00:00:10.683 --> 00:00:15.000
He is a baby boy.

3
00:00:15.001 --> 00:00:18.514
My baby brother needs many things:

4
00:00:18.515 --> 00:00:26.344
a crib, a cradle, some bottles, and some toys.

5
00:00:26.345 --> 00:00:33.147
Sometimes my baby brother is no fun.

6
00:00:33.148 --> 00:00:37.129
He sleeps a lot.

7
00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:41.617
He eats a lot.

8
00:00:41.618 --> 00:00:46.402
He cries a lot.

9
00:00:46.403 --> 00:00:52.228
He sits on Mommy's lap a lot.

10
00:00:52.229 --> 00:00:56.667
He makes Mommy very busy.

11
00:00:56.668 --> 00:01:03.849
Sometimes it is fun to be a big sister.

12
00:01:03.850 --> 00:01:08.840
I help Mommy rock his cradle.

13
00:01:08.841 --> 00:01:16.956
Then, my brother smiles at me.

14
00:01:16.957 --> 00:01:20.058
I hold a rattle for my brother.

15
00:01:20.059 --> 00:01:23.527
He laughs.

16
00:01:23.528 --> 00:01:29.365
Someday I will play with him.
